[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2707905269","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103787#issuecomment-2707905269","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103787","id":2707905269,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6hZ1r1","user":{"login":"bit-garden","id":10319571,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMzE5NTcx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10319571?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bit-garden","html_url":"https://github.com/bit-garden","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bit-garden/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bit-garden/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bit-garden/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bit-garden/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bit-garden/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bit-garden/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bit-garden/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bit-garden/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bit-garden/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-08T02:22:14Z","updated_at":"2025-03-08T02:22:14Z","body":"Small update. It seems to be related to the mobile project profile. \n\nThis is no longer related to an Android created project. Changing the render to mobile will prevent Godot on Windows from opening the project.\n\nManually reverting the changes in the project.godot file will allow the project to be opened again.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2707905269/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2707908579","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103787#issuecomment-2707908579","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103787","id":2707908579,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6hZ2fj","user":{"login":"bit-garden","id":10319571,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMzE5NTcx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10319571?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bit-garden","html_url":"https://github.com/bit-garden","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bit-garden/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bit-garden/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bit-garden/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bit-garden/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bit-garden/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bit-garden/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bit-garden/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bit-garden/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bit-garden/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-08T02:29:05Z","updated_at":"2025-03-08T02:29:05Z","body":"Oh, nevermind. Attempting to create a mobile project explains the error. \n\nMaybe a better mode of failure can help avoid this confusion. Maybe a notice on the project list window and an option to change renderer before opening?\n\nAlso disallowing changing the render to an unsupported one?\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7d8da53b-5132-441e-80f4-aa0bacc294bb)","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2707908579/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2711570658","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103787#issuecomment-2711570658","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103787","id":2711570658,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6hn0ji","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-10T19:08:01Z","updated_at":"2025-03-10T19:10:03Z","body":"The Radeon R7 200 series indeed has no Vulkan support, so seeing that message is intended here (unlike https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103902).\n\nIt's strange that the fallback to Compatibility isn't working on your end though. When the graphics driver doesn't support RenderingDevice, Godot should fall back to Compatibility automatically since 4.4 thanks to https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/97142.\n\n> This is no longer related to an Android created project. Changing the render to mobile will prevent Godot on Windows from opening the project.\n\nI would still allow changing it in this case (after warning the user that they'll be affected by the automatic fallback), since it'll affect the exported project.\n\nIf we fix the fallback, the project will be able to open again after changing the rendering method.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2711570658/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2901654439","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103787#issuecomment-2901654439","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103787","id":2901654439,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6s87un","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-22T15:24:09Z","updated_at":"2025-05-22T15:24:09Z","body":"Can you still reproduce this issue with Godot 4.4.1?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2901654439/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket"